ActionApps
=======================
ActionApps (under the GPL) provide easy automated publishing for
non-profit WWW sites and 'Usenet-like' sharing of articles between sites.

Features
========
- Complete web publishing system: no HTML skills required
- Fully online service: all you need is a web browser
- Article manager: all features packed into one browser-based control panel
- Configurable output: make ActionApps look like your web site
- Moderation tools: share the load of posting articles online
- Discussion support
- Content Pooling: Swap content with other ActionApps users on any server
- Classify articles using built-in categories (or create your own)
- Search engine included
- Alerts and Links modules included
- Multilingual support: English, Spanish, Czech, Slovak, Deutch, Romanian and
  Japan included (easy to add new languages)


Install and update
==================
See INSTALL.md (new installation from git) and UPDATE.md (updating, and moving
an SVN installation to git).


Contact
=======
See https://actionapps.org/ for more info about ActionApps

See https://github.com/apc-aa/ActionApps for

  source code and its history (branch "main")
  the "dist" branch that installations update from (see INSTALL)
  bug tracking and feature requests (issues)

See https://sourceforge.net/projects/apc-aa/ for the SVN mirror of the dist
branch and the archived trackers.

See https://actionapps.org/ for recent documentation, or look in the doc/ subdirectory.
